## 2. What Actually Runs

### Analysis Pipeline Flow
1. `src/stores/gameStore.ts` → `autoAnalyzeGame()` or manual trigger
2. `src/stores/gameStore.ts:452` → `runEvaluationPipeline()` — sequential FEN loop
3. `src/lib/engine/evaluate.ts:25-29` → `getEngineVersion()` — **always returns `'stockfish-18-lite-single.js'`** (single-threaded)
4. `src/lib/engine/evaluate.ts:21-23` → `getOptimalEngineCount()` — **hardcoded `return 1`**
5. `src/lib/engine/index.ts` → `Engine` class: `new Worker('/engines/' + version)` — single Stockfish WASM worker
6. Sequential processing: one FEN position at a time, one game at a time

### Engine Files
- `src/lib/engine/index.ts` — `Engine` class (worker management)
- `src/lib/engine/evaluate.ts` — orchestrator (version selection, count, pipeline)
- `src/lib/engine/warmup.ts` — engine warmup
- `src/lib/engine/legacy.ts` — legacy engine support

### WASM Builds in `/public/engines/`
| File | Status | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| `stockfish-18-lite-single.js` | ✅ **Used** | Single-threaded |
| `stockfish-18-lite.js` | ❌ Unused | Multi-threaded, requires SharedArrayBuffer/COOP/COEP headers (absent on Cloudflare Pages) |
| `stockfish-17-lite-single.js` | ❌ Legacy | Old version |

### Known Issues
- **Memory leak:** `Engine.terminate()` sends UCI `quit` but never calls `worker.terminate()` Web API
- **No memory tracking:** `performance.now()` measures duration (`analysisDurationMs`) but zero RAM/CPU monitoring

