## 4. Performance Bottlenecks & Speed-Up Opportunities

| Bottleneck | Current State | Potential | Estimated Speedup |
|-----------|--------------|-----------|-------------------|
| Single engine (1 worker) | Sequential FEN loop | Spawn N workers, parallel positions | **N× (8-16×)** |
| Single-threaded WASM | `stockfish-18-lite-single.js` | Use `stockfish-18-lite.js` + SharedArrayBuffer | **2-4× per position** |
| No position caching | Recomputes all FENs | Transposition table / FEN hash cache | **Significant** |
| Sequential game queue | One game at a time | Parallel game analysis | **N×** |
| Remote eval stubs | Mock data only | Real Stockfish WASM in edge functions | **Offload** |
| Distributed toggle | Dead flag | Full WebRTC peer pool implementation | **Horizontal scale** |

